      "original_detector": "review",
      "original_file": ".",
      "original_summary": "Azure and GitLab PR strategies receive a `token` parameter in CloseExistingPROptions and PRStrategyOptions but never use it. The token field exists because the interface is shared with GitHub, but Azure/GitLab silently ignore it, relying on CLI-level auth (az/glab login). This is documented in the type comments but could confuse callers.",
