      "original_detector": "review",
      "original_file": ".",
      "original_summary": "normalizer.ts contains two nearly parallel merge pipelines: mergeSettings (for final normalized output) and mergeRawSettings (for group-layer accumulation). Both handle rulesets, labels, repo settings, and deleteOrphaned with similar logic but different type signatures. The structural overlap creates maintenance risk \u2014 changes to merge semantics must be made in both places.",
